  "releaseNotes": "3.0.3 — Package metadata and docs cleanup (Aminovate ownership).\n      3.0.2 — Fix AddDays/Add* mutating the receiver, which shifted monthly calendar\n      days by one and made holidays/Fridays appear as working days. Fridays now also\n      get weekend holiday metadata. GenerateMonthlyCalender matches yearly calendar.\n      3.0.1 — Time.ir-aligned official holidays for Shamsi 1403–1406 (Hijri calibration\n      through lunar 1449), occasion catalog refresh, and yearly sync tooling.\n      3.0.0 — Initial ParsKit release.",
